[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 421.749, "timestamp": "00:07:01", "text": "それで、[笑い]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 424.39, "timestamp": "00:07:04", "text": "今年のこの時期にはそれができませんでした。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 427.749, "timestamp": "00:07:07", "text": "でも大丈夫だよ。 来年、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 430.629, "timestamp": "00:07:10", "text": "再来年はできるよ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 433.029, "timestamp": "00:07:13", "text": "なぜできないの？ 来年は一人になるので、そうしなければなりません"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 434.95, "timestamp": "00:07:14", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 438.79, "timestamp": "00:07:18", "text": "家族のような人は誰もいないでしょう。 つまり、それは何かです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 442.39, "timestamp": "00:07:22", "text": "。 おお。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 444.74, "timestamp": "00:07:24", "text": "うん。 来年はそれをやらなければなりません。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 445.909, "timestamp": "00:07:25", "text": "[笑い]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 453.43, "timestamp": "00:07:33", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 455.99, "timestamp": "00:07:35", "text": "喉の調子が本当に悪いんです。 ということで、今日も"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 458.30899999999997, "timestamp": "00:07:38", "text": "部屋の掃除をします。 私の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 460.87, "timestamp": "00:07:40", "text": "オフィススペース。 えっと、私のストリームshストリーム"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 462.55, "timestamp": "00:07:42", "text": "ルームです。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 466.07, "timestamp": "00:07:46", "text": "それで、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 470.55, "timestamp": "00:07:50", "text": "何時に終わるかは分かりませんが、ええと、"}]